course: dictionary
lesson: 2045
title: Hard words about the body
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some medical words look scary, but the sentences around them can help you. «Waking up with your eyes glued shut by yellow gunk is usually conjunctivitis, pink eye.» The sentence gives another name straight after the hard word, so conjunctivitis must be a problem with the eyes.
explain: Look for clues about how something feels or looks. «Red, sticky, itchy eyes may be conjunctivitis.» Red, sticky and itchy are the clues. Conjunctivitis is an eye infection or irritation that makes the eye red, itchy, sore and sometimes sticky.
explain: Context can also tell you what to do. «She uses only her own towel, so her conjunctivitis does not spread to her sisters.» The towel detail tells you that conjunctivitis can spread when people share things, so do not share towels. Check your guess by putting it in the sentence: "her red, itchy eye problem does not spread" still makes sense, so you are right.
fact: Conjunctivitis is an eye infection or irritation, also called pink eye.
fact: Conjunctivitis makes the eye red, itchy, sore and sometimes sticky.
fact: Germs can spread conjunctivitis by touching your eyes and sharing towels, so wash your hands and do not rub your eyes.
fact: A doctor or pharmacist can help if you have conjunctivitis.
fact: «Allergic conjunctivitis» is caused by things like pollen and is not catching.
exercise: «Red, sticky, itchy eyes may be conjunctivitis.» What is conjunctivitis? | A kind of bicycle with a bell | *An eye infection or irritation that makes the eye red and itchy | Sore feet after a long walk | A type of cloud that brings rain
exercise: Another name for conjunctivitis is what? | *Pink eye | Pinkish sunshine | A pink balloon | A pink dress
exercise: Why should you not share towels if you have conjunctivitis? | *It can spread the germs to other people | It makes the towel pink | The towel gets too dry | Towels must be washed in the sea
test: «Allergic conjunctivitis from pollen is not catching.» What does not catching mean? | *It cannot spread to other people | It makes you run fast | It needs a bigger medicine | It is very hard to catch in a game
test: Which person can help if you have conjunctivitis? | *A doctor or pharmacist | Nobody, so rub your eyes harder | A friend who has a pond to swim in | Your sister, by sharing her towel
exam: What is the best way to stop conjunctivitis spreading? | Lend your towel to a friend | *Wash your hands and do not rub your eyes | Share your eye drops with everyone in class | Rub your eyes, then touch your friend's face
